  "comment": "Ask (chatQuery) golden set: 10 questions as 5 two-turn conversations over the parse eval's corpus manuals (scripts/parse-eval/corpus.json), each asked with that ONE manual attached whole — the item-scoped question prompt caching is for. Turn 2 is a follow-up in the same conversation, which is the turn that should read the cached PDF. Every expected fact was checked against the manual's own text (not the parser's paraphrase) on 2026-09-30.",
